	(text_box "BSPD (EV.8.7)\nTo Do:\n- Math on Current Sensor -> calculate the voltage coming from the current sensor \nand then create a voltage divider to supply said voltage to the reference pin \nof an op-amp \n\n- 1 second capacitor -> op-amp comparator circuit\n\n- Logic on 0.5 second timing on \"loss of signal\" (EV.8.7.2)\n\n- Relay connection"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 199.39 19.9923 0)
		(size 30.48 40.7516)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
		(stroke
